    "readme_description": "You are given a binary matrix `matrix` of size `m x n`, and you are allowed to rearrange the **columns** of the `matrix` in any order.\n\nReturn *the area of the largest submatrix within* `matrix` *where **every** element of the submatrix is* `1` *after reordering the columns optimally.*",
